      "created_at": "2012-09-20T17:14:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I think I should have understood this before (in the base game, that is) but does the plating hit back at each target that does damage to Ambuscade the first time during the turn? For example, if each hero does damage to Ambuscade during one turn does each hero get hit with reactive plating or does only the first hero?</p>",
