      "username": "TheJayMann",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-20T17:16:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe it has been stated that when a card says \"The first time &lt;player X&gt; is dealt damage by a target each turn,\" it reacts for each different target in a single turn.&nbsp; It just won't react the second time a single target deals damage that same turn.</p>",
