      "id": 38879,
      "name": "Cosmonaut Zero",
      "username": "Cosmonaut_Zero",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cosmonaut_zero/{size}/2520_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-20T18:06:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That said, it's not that common for multiple heroes to be doing damage on the same turn. Fanatic's Divine Focus and some of Argent Adept's stuff that lets other players play cards or use powers are the biggest examples I can think of. For the most part Heroes tend to do their damage on their own turns. What you might see more often is all of Unity's golems getting slapped, or a hero redirecting the backlash damage from Ambuscade to himself, which would make the Reactive plating hit itself.</p>",
