      "created_at": "2012-09-20T20:40:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh yeah, there's tons of ways for one hero to do damage twice in a turn. I mean, Fanatic has one printed on her character card. I was just talking about multiple targets on a turn becuase that's what btabrisky was asking about.</p><p>Also, I was trying to subtly highlight that each hero's turn does in fact count as it's own turn, since the scenario where every hero does damage on the same turn would be such a rare occurrence. (^_~)</p>",
